we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{4{log}_{4}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =4{\\int }_{1}^{4}{log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡4{\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot (1-0) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4 \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040971/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7391e8a050e87b39314ad2bc50902d905996e5b766a03cd61bc3ae194fc2c71" "basis" 1472 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040971/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73653" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040971/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a6b9dd97b5feca6bb8daa5aa762c6e122276f1a8b769932d775323ba90d448fa" "basis" 1472 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040971/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73653" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040971/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7391e8a050e87b39314ad2bc50902d905996e5b766a03cd61bc3ae194fc2c71" "basis" 1472 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-ca