d}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/state.json" "file_sha256" "0954e2dcc1963f75a4f6bfee5962ea7b629c861f87b01fccab2ecd7cac532731" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73659" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88b04a28acd4d8c79e101e9c9e9690d5266f0dc014b1b37dc30f9e50b76e5a87" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73659" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/state.json" "file_sha256" "0954e2dcc1963f75a4f6bfee5962ea7b629c861f87b01fccab2ecd7cac532731" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{3{log}_{6}^{2}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/state.json" "file_sha256" "0954e2dcc1963f75a4f6bfee5962ea7b629c861f87b01fccab2ecd7cac532731" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{6}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡6}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3{log}_{6}^{2}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int ({log}_{6}⁡x)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =3\\int {u}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\int {u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{3}}{3}+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot {log}_{6}^{3}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/state.json" "file_sha256" "0954e2dcc1963f75a4f6bfee5962ea7b629c861f87b01fccab2ecd7cac532731" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88b04a28acd4d8c79e101e9c9e9690d5266f0dc014b1b37dc30f9e50b76e5a87" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039202/state.json" "file_sha256" "0954e2dcc1963f75a4f6bfee5962ea7b629c861f87b01fccab2ecd7cac532731" "basis" 1351 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-