e" "Let's set $u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}).$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\cdot 2x=\\frac{2}{x}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})}{3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}\\cdot  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int u\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}{u}^{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13807" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c423bfc653e06a330fcb95a0f17433b4888dfe6f20bc47c1eac6303ac7ef1edc"} {"question" "q-13807" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13807" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡|x|+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{6}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13807" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13803" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13803" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's set $u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{u}^{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{ln}^{2}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13803" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c423bfc653e06a330fcb95a0f17433b4888dfe6f20bc47c1eac6303ac7ef1edc"} {"question" "q-13803" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13803" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}{ln}^{2}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4}{ln}^{2}⁡x+C"] ["math" "{ln}^{2}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-13803" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{4}{ln}^{2}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-31329" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-31329" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{2}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {log}_{2}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\int u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}^{2}⁡x}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-31329" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c423bfc653e06a330fcb95a0f17433b4888dfe6f20bc47c1eac6303ac7ef1edc"} {"question" "q-31329" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-31329" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}^{2}⁡x}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡x}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡x}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}^{2}⁡x}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}^{2}⁡x}{x}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-31329" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{2}^{2}⁡x}{2}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-73659" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{1}{x{log}_{7}⁡(4x)}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-73659" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{7}⁡(4x).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{x{log}_{7}⁡(4x)}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{log}_{7}⁡(4x)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{7}⁡(4x)|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-73659" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c423bfc653e06a330fcb95a0f17433b4888dfe6f20bc47c1eac6303ac7ef1edc"} {"question" "q-73659" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-fiel