 the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3{log}_{6}^{2}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int ({log}_{6}⁡x)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =3\\int {u}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\int {u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{3}}{3}+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot {log}_{6}^{3}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c423bfc653e06a330fcb95a0f17433b4888dfe6f20bc47c1eac6303ac7ef1edc"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "3\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot {log}_{6}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡6}{3}\\cdot {log}_{6}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot {log}_{6}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡6\\cdot {log}_{6}⁡x+C"] ["math" "{log}_{6}^{3}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042968/state.json" "file_sha256" "d32a102433672e84143541a133d44b6ff3ca7625b16d6ca3de809fd6ed9c52ce"} {"question" "q-114020" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.typ